# Checklist 39 (the emulator half): fly one satellite pass on the
# emulated mount. arm-pass moves the satellite clock so the first
# trackable pass opens in 45 s; a real one can be hours away.
name    Satellite pass: one, on the emulated mount
timeout 420

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Satellite
wait   5
press  GOTO:PASSES
wait   5
arm-pass 45
expect 5   [SCENARIO] armed
press  GOTO:TRACK SELECTED PASS
expect 10  Satellite: slewing
expect 150 on target, recording.
# Named for the satellite, not the "Jupiter" startup default, and not
# cut short by the 1000-frame default limit (50 s at 20 fps): phase 127.
# A low pass may simply end sooner, so it is the exact limit that fails.
expect 10  Recording started
absent 1   captures\Jupiter_
absent 60  Recording stopped: 1000 frames
shot   tracking
press  GOTO:STOP TRACKING
wait   5
